==Description==
The Assembly Station is the staple of building your ship. When placed, you can interact to build any [[Ship Components|ship component]] you have learned. The part will then materialise above the assembly station and fall to the ground. You can manipulate the object with the [[Gauntlet#Shipbuilding Tool|Shipbuilding Tool]] (Default {{Key|3}}), and place it on your ship.

== Crafting ==
You can craft an Assembly Station, along with a [[Shipyard]], by first researching [[Shipbuilding]] in the [[Knowledge]] tree (250 knowledge).

